1. 壁纸与预览图（backgrounds/、preview.png）
   Wallpapers and preview image (backgrounds/, preview.png)

   壁纸均取自已进入公有领域的中国古代绘画（图像来自 Wikimedia Commons），
   可自由使用；其中《明皇幸蜀图》图像由国立故宫博物院依 CC BY 4.0
   （https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/）提供，使用时须署名。
   作品信息见 README.md。
   All wallpapers are details of public-domain Chinese paintings (images
   via Wikimedia Commons) and are free to use, except that the image of
   Emperor Minghuang's Journey to Shu is provided by the National Palace
   Museum under CC BY 4.0 and requires attribution. See README.md.

